     margins (LR 5.1(D)) and a centered page number (LR 5.1(E)), its line 34.3 pt above the page foot (686 twips:
     where typst sets it, footer-descent 30 %). docx/gand-motion-brief.lua writes every paragraph's own spacing.
     Twips: 20 x pt. -->
